ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja432:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja432:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja432:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja432:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja432:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja432:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja432:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja432:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja432:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja432:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja432:12.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja432:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja432:0.2": "Navakanipāta ", "ja432:0.3": "Gijjhavagga ", "ja432:0.4": "6. Padakusalamāṇavajātaka ", "ja432:1.1": "“Bahussutaṁ cittakathiṁ, ", "ja432:1.2": "gaṅgā vahati pāṭaliṁ; ", "ja432:1.3": "Vuyhamānaka bhaddante, ", "ja432:1.4": "ekaṁ me dehi gāthakaṁ”. ", "ja432:2.1": "“Yena siñcanti dukkhitaṁ, ", "ja432:2.2": "yena siñcanti āturaṁ; ", "ja432:2.3": "Tassa majjhe marissāmi, ", "ja432:2.4": "jātaṁ saraṇato bhayaṁ”. ", "ja432:3.1": "“Yattha bījāni rūhanti, ", "ja432:3.2": "sattā yattha patiṭṭhitā; ", "ja432:3.3": "Sā me sīsaṁ nipīḷeti, ", "ja432:3.4": "jātaṁ saraṇato bhayaṁ”. ", "ja432:4.1": "“Yena bhattāni paccanti, ", "ja432:4.2": "sītaṁ yena vihaññati; ", "ja432:4.3": "So maṁ ḍahati gattāni, ", "ja432:4.4": "jātaṁ saraṇato bhayaṁ”. ", "ja432:5.1": "“Yena bhuttena yāpenti, ", "ja432:5.2": "puthū brāhmaṇakhattiyā; ", "ja432:5.3": "So maṁ bhutto byāpādeti, ", "ja432:5.4": "jātaṁ saraṇato bhayaṁ”. ", "ja432:6.1": "“Gimhānaṁ pacchime māse, ", "ja432:6.2": "vātamicchanti paṇḍitā; ", "ja432:6.3": "So maṁ bhañjati gattāni, ", "ja432:6.4": "jātaṁ saraṇato bhayaṁ”. ", "ja432:7.1": "“Yaṁ nissitā jagatiruhaṁ, ", "ja432:7.2": "svāyaṁ aggiṁ pamuñcati; ", "ja432:7.3": "Disā bhajatha vakkaṅgā, ", "ja432:7.4": "jātaṁ saraṇato bhayaṁ”. ", "ja432:8.1": "“Yamānayiṁ somanassaṁ, ", "ja432:8.2": "māliniṁ candanussadaṁ; ", "ja432:8.3": "Sā maṁ gharā nicchubhati, ", "ja432:8.4": "jātaṁ saraṇato bhayaṁ”. ", "ja432:9.1": "“Yena jātena nandissaṁ, ", "ja432:9.2": "yassa ca bhavamicchisaṁ; ", "ja432:9.3": "So maṁ gharā nicchubhati, ", "ja432:9.4": "jātaṁ saraṇato bhayaṁ”. ", "ja432:10.1": "“Suṇantu me jānapadā, ", "ja432:10.2": "negamā ca samāgatā; ", "ja432:10.3": "Yatodakaṁ tadādittaṁ, ", "ja432:10.4": "yato khemaṁ tato bhayaṁ. ", "ja432:11.1": "Rājā vilumpate raṭṭhaṁ, ", "ja432:11.2": "brāhmaṇo ca purohito; ", "ja432:11.3": "Attaguttā viharatha, ", "ja432:11.4": "jātaṁ saraṇato bhayan”ti. ", "ja432:12.1": "Padakusalamāṇavajātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja432:0.1": "", "ja432:0.2": "", "ja432:0.3": "", "ja432:0.4": "", "ja432:1.1": "cittakathiṁ → cittakathaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja432:1.2": "pāṭaliṁ → pāṭalaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja432:1.3": "", "ja432:1.4": "dehi → gāhi (pts-vp-pli1) | gāthakaṁ → gītakaṁ (Ma-aka) ", "ja432:2.1": "", "ja432:2.2": "", "ja432:2.3": "", "ja432:2.4": "", "ja432:3.1": "", "ja432:3.2": "", "ja432:3.3": "", "ja432:3.4": "", "ja432:4.1": "", "ja432:4.2": "", "ja432:4.3": "ḍahati → dayhati (mr) | maṁ → so me (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja432:4.4": "", "ja432:5.1": "bhuttena → bhattena (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja432:5.2": "", "ja432:5.3": "", "ja432:5.4": "", "ja432:6.1": "", "ja432:6.2": "", "ja432:6.3": "", "ja432:6.4": "", "ja432:7.1": "", "ja432:7.2": "", "ja432:7.3": "", "ja432:7.4": "", "ja432:8.1": "", "ja432:8.2": "", "ja432:8.3": "nicchubhati → nīharati (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja432:8.4": "", "ja432:9.1": "", "ja432:9.2": "", "ja432:9.3": "nicchubhati → nīharati (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja432:9.4": "", "ja432:10.1": "", "ja432:10.2": "", "ja432:10.3": "", "ja432:10.4": "", "ja432:11.1": "", "ja432:11.2": "", "ja432:11.3": "", "ja432:11.4": "", "ja432:12.1": "Padakusalamāṇavajātakaṁ → padamāṇavakajātakaṁ (bj) "}, "reference_text": {"ja432:0.1": "", "ja432:0.2": "", "ja432:0.3": "", "ja432:0.4": "", "ja432:1.1": "bj30.334, dr27.259, ms22J_1834, msdiv49,